WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.410
- How much time do we have?

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.210
- About eight minutes,

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.628
but we can stop.

00:00:11.628 --> 00:00:13.780
I just have to get you to sign this.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.103
- So you're not even curious?

00:00:20.981 --> 00:00:21.814
- About what?

00:00:21.814 --> 00:00:23.053
- About why I'm here.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.110
The lying thing, why I do that,

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:29.863
or why I'd make something like that up?

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.120
- I'm curious about
you, Marie, who you are.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.473
- That's not what I asked.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.813
- Here's what I think,

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.180
no one makes up something like that

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.130
unless there's an element of truth to it.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.600
Whether you were raped that night

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.563
or invented a story about
being raped that night,

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:58.013
I think the truth is you've been violated.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.050
You're carrying burdens
that were dumped on you

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.550
by people who didn't love you as well

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.053
as you deserve to be loved.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:10.110
And that's what I'm curious about,

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.610
how I might help you carry those burdens

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:17.053
a little more lightly or maybe
even lay some of them down.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.203
But this is your time.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.370
And we have a few minutes
if there's something

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.220
you want to tell me about that night,

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.813
I would love to listen.

00:01:56.463 --> 00:01:58.370
(ominous music)

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:00.923
So basically you were assaulted twice,

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.683
once by your attacker,
then again by the police.

00:02:08.538 --> 00:02:09.620
- I guess.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.340
- I am so sorry, Marie.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.470
- It's not your fault.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:16.120
- It's brave of you to revisit it.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:17.233
That's not easy.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:20.763
Thank you for trusting me.

00:02:27.498 --> 00:02:30.248
(mouse clicking)

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.790
Can I ask you one thing before you go?

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:55.623
- Okay.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:59.130
- Understanding that none
of this was your fault,

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:03.060
it was a horrible situation
that was imposed on you,

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:08.060
I wonder if there's something
of value you can take from it.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.730
This might not be the
last time in your life

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:18.730
that you're misunderstood or mistrusted.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:23.160
I just wonder if there's
a way to think about it,

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:27.290
about how you might manage
this kind of injustice

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.233
if it were to happen again.

00:03:31.234 --> 00:03:33.901
(ominous music)

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:38.680
- Okay, I know I'm supposed to say

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.373
if I had to do if over, I wouldn't lie.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:48.390
But the truth is, I would
lie earlier and better.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.973
- Recognize everyone?

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:58.920
- Yeah, we know them.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:06.373
- I would just figure it
out on my own, by myself.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.520
- All right, well you let us know

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.018
when you get into that hard drive.

00:04:13.018 --> 00:04:13.851
- Wait, hang on.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.100
There's one more.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:22.523
- No matter how much someone
says they care about you,

00:04:22.523 --> 00:04:23.643
they just don't.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.223
Not enough.

00:04:31.562 --> 00:04:34.930
I mean, maybe they mean to or they try to,

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:38.243
but other things end up
being more important.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.360
- He reused this one a bunch,

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.010
so the quality's pretty degraded.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.890
But there are eight
pictures he that he deleted,

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.140
but didn't overwrite yet.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.470
There's someone else.

00:04:54.849 --> 00:04:57.516
(ominous music)

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:01.713
- So yeah, I guess I'd start with that.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:05.413
Lying.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:08.113
'Cause even with good people,

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.043
even with people that you can kinda trust,

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.263
if the truth is inconvenient,

00:05:22.454 --> 00:05:25.633
if the truth doesn't fit,

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.440
they don't believe it.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.273
- Who is that?

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.593
- She looks 12.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.993
- Even if they really care about you,

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.193
they just,

00:05:45.161 --> 00:05:46.494
they just don't.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.487
(ominous music)

